ilding both her stats.","acc":[{"label":"Best","main":"BossDMG","main_info":{"icon":"R-BossDMG.webp","key":"BossDMG","tier":"R","label":"Boss DMG","value":"+12%"},"sub":"13AOE","sub_info":{"icon":"R-13AOE.webp","key":"13AOE","tier":"R","label":"1-3 Target DMG","value":"+10%"}},{"label":"Alt 1","main":"BossDMG","main_info":{"icon":"R-BossDMG.webp","key":"BossDMG","tier":"R","label":"Boss DMG","value":"+12%"},"sub":"CritRate","sub_info":{"icon":"C-CritRate.webp","key":"CritRate","tier":"C","label":"Crit Rate","value":"+10%"}},{"label":"Alt 2","main":"BossDMG","main_info":{"icon":"R-BossDMG.webp","key":"BossDMG","tier":"R","label":"Boss DMG","value":"+12%"},"sub":"WeaknessHit","sub_info":{"icon":"C-WeaknessHit.webp","key":"WeaknessHit","tier":"C","label":"Weakness Hit","value":"+12%"}}]}],"dedicated":{"name":"Ruri's Crusaders Badge","main_stat":"MATK +247","icon":"Ruri.webp","a":[{"name":"DMGAmp","value":"+4%","icon":"DMGAmp.webp"},{"name":"DMGAmp","value":"+4%","icon":"DMGAmp.webp"},{"name":"DMGAmp","value":"+4%","icon":"DMGAmp.webp"},{"name":"DMGAmp","value":"+4%","icon":"DMGAmp.webp"}],"b":[{"name":"AllATK%","value":"+12%","icon":"AllATK%25.webp"},{"name":"AllATK%","value":"+12%","icon":"AllATK%25.webp"},{"name":"AllATK%","value":"+12%","icon":"AllATK%25.webp"},{"name":"AllATK%","value":"+12%","icon":"AllATK%25.webp"}],"second":"no","why_by_stat":{"DMGAmp":"Increases all damage dealt by Ruri by the given %, making it useful for both general damage and higher PVE scores. Also increases DOT damage."},"story":"Having gained renown in the past for capturing the notorious wanted criminal known as Joker, Ruri made a living by taking on various commissions to fund her younger sister's medical treatment. Later, after the Holy Cross Crusaders made countless persistent attempts to recruit her, she finally decided to join their ranks, convinced by their mission to protect the world and her sister's encouragement. To ensure that her firearms remained in top condition, Ruri also recommended Nia to the organization, and thus the two joined the Crusaders together."},"used_in":[{"tip":"Advent Expedition: Yeonhee","cat":"pve","banner":"ADVENT_YH.webp"},{"tip":"Tower of Trials","cat":"pve","banner":"TOWER_OF_TRIALS.webp"},{"tip":"Castle Rush (Mon/Tue/Wed)","cat":"pve","banner":"CR_MONTUESWED.webp"}],"lore":"Ruri is an energetic, mischievous, and optimistic person. She's still very inexperienced with her work, but gives her all to her job like a professional.\nShe's the kind of person who acts cute instead of dressing cute.\nDespite her rather happy-go-lucky attitude, she and her sister are orphans and had an impoverished neighborhood. She became a bounty hunter in the hopes that she'd be able to afford treatment for her sickly sister.\nShe was able to catch Joker and turn him in for a huge bounty. Some of the money went toward her sister's treatment, but she donated the rest of it to the orphanage she grew up in and various other ones around the continent.\nAfter she captured the elusive black magician Joker, she was scouted by the Crusaders.\nShe uses a high-tech rifle made by Nia.\nShe's quite interested in Sieg, but he's too thick to get it."}